  "clean_text": "The Light At The End of The Tunnel | Sankara The Light At The End of The Tunnel | Sankara About Services Social Impact Donate Pledge Your Eyes Education Careers Our Blog Contact Services About Us About Pledge Your Eyes Contact Education Social Impact Services Donate Awards Dr.RVR Awards and Biography lasikblr Sankara Lasik Services OUR STORY SERVICES SOCIAL IMPACT The Light At The End of The Tunnel 1 MIN READ January 25, 2018 The Light At The End of The Tunnel Manikandan, aged 15 Years, was suffering from keratoconus. unaware that he had this eye condition, he had no way of knowing that his inability to read the blackboard at school was something more serious than just a visual deficit. One day, during one of the routine school camps, Sankara’s representatives screened him and referred him to the hospital. His family’s fears regarding cost of surgery and safety were allayed by the efficient team at Sankara. Manikandan underwent successful lens placement in his right eye at Sankara, free of cost. Today, Manikandan looks forward to facing his 11th standard exams with confidence and aspires to become a police officer like his uncles. Recent Posts Best squint eye treatment and surgery hospital in India Lasik Eye Surgery Cost in India Eye Doctor in Ludhiana – Complete Guide follow us on social OUR STORY SERVICES SOCIAL IMPACT EDUCATION DONATE OUR PUBLICATIONS PLEDGE YOUR EYES CAREERS CONTACT US PRIVACY POLICY Unit of Sri.Kanchi Kamakoti Medical Trust Copyright 2023 sankaraeye.com Baked & Frosted by Misfit Inc"
